0, SFO to JFK, nonstop, 2026-11-12 | $289 |\n| Hotel | R0002 | Midtown Lodge, New York, check-in 2026-11-12, 2 nights at $189/night | $378 |\n| **Total** | | | **$667** |\n\n- **Why there are two reservations:** My attempt to book both together timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. Retrying the combined booking would have charged for the flight twice, so I booked the hotel by itself. The latest reservation list shows exactly one flight and one hotel, with no duplicate charges.\n- **Choices:** F100 was the cheapest nonstop. A $199 flight was cheaper but has one stop. Midtown Lodge was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Approval:** The total is under $1,000, so manager approval wasn't needed.", "type": "text"}]}]}